id: shifting-buddy
name: Shifting Buddy
kind: gear
itemType: buddy
# As a Ride Buddy it has Flyin' or Dodgin' too, by the table's ruling - chosen when it is given.
buddyEffect: activated
maneuverType: instant
actionCost: 0
buddyAction: shift
chooses: ride
rideSize: large
shiftLimit: 3
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Active, as an Instant: a Weapon, a Ride Buddy or an Assault Buddy until the end of the Round.
  Three times an Encounter, never two Rounds running.
text: >
  Shifting Buddy: This handy little friend changes shape to suit your needs.
  –Buddy Effect Type: Active
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –Effects: Your Buddy shapeshifts, turning into one of the following things until the end of
  the Combat Round:

  * Weapon. Create a Weapon with a Craftsmanship Grade equal to 1/2 (rounded up) of your base
  Tier of Power that you may immediately equip. Your Buddy isn’t automatically destroyed if hit
  as a Weapon, but this Weapon’s Life Points are equal to your Buddy Attribute and if it is
  destroyed, then your Buddy is destroyed.

  * Ride Buddy. Your Buddy can use the Buddy Effect of a Ride Buddy.

  * Assault Buddy. Your Buddy can use the Buddy Effect of an Assault Buddy.

  Your Shifting Buddy can only use their Buddy Effect 3 times per Combat Encounter and cannot
  use their Buddy Effect if they used it during the last Combat Round.
  –Adventure Effect: Your Buddy may use the Morph Adventuring Maneuver in your place.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Use, on its row, while it is Active: what it becomes, until the end of the Combat Round.
#
# - A Weapon: a Weapon made on the spot at Craftsmanship Grade 1/2 of the base Tier (rounded up),
#   built on its own sheet at that Grade's Slots, and wielded if a hand is free. Its Life Points
#   are the Buddy Attribute; if it breaks the Buddy is Destroyed. Gone at the end of the Round.
# - A Ride Buddy: the Ride Buddy's Buddy Effect on its row this Round, with Flyin' or Dodgin'.
# - An Assault Buddy: the Assault Buddy's, a Profile chosen at each use.
#
# Three times a Combat Encounter, and not in a Round right after one it was used in.
#
# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Its Adventure Effect: the Morph Adventuring Maneuver is not in this system.

[passive]
if ($shiftedRide == 1 && $flyin == 1) {
  allow maneuver.soar;
}
if ($shiftedRide == 1 && $dodgin == 1) {
  dodge += 1(bT);
}
